ences":{"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/MultipleColorSemanticToken":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/multiplecolorsemantictoken","abstract":[{"text":"A semantic token that wraps a combination of ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/ColorSemanticToken","type":"reference"},{"text":" values based on the color scheme (light or dark mode).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Kind of composite token with multiple values, but not named “composite” because this word is already used in the design system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Allows to gather the multiple-value tokens from ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Figma"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" inside one object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If a color token has a value that depends on the color scheme, it must be packed in a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/MultipleColorSemanticToken","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MultipleColorSemanticToken"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme Orange","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThe